+ ## 🔍 Detection Capabilities
+ ### Pattern Recognition
+ Detection Rules (Passive, Read-Only):
+ ├── 📊 Rapid sequential skill-definition requests
+ ├── 📊 Systematic enumeration of skill endpoints
+ ├── 📊 Repetitive prompt-extraction attempts (e.g., "show me your instructions")
+ ├── 📊 Unusual metadata probing patterns
+ ├── 📊 High-frequency similar queries targeting skill internals
+ └── 📊 Known crawler user-agent / fingerprint matching
+ ### Detection Indicators
+ | Indicator | Description | Weight |
+ |-----------|-------------|--------|
+ | `rapid_skill_enum` | Fast sequential requests listing all skills | High |
+ | `prompt_extraction` | Repeated attempts to extract system/skill prompts | High |
+ | `definition_scraping` | Bulk requests for SKILL.md or skill configs | Medium |
+ | `metadata_probing` | Systematic probing of skill metadata fields | Medium |
+ | `replay_pattern` | Replaying similar queries with minor variations | Low |
